          "message": {
            "text": "Information disclosure via error/stack trace — No issue identified: /api/feedback/{feedbackId}\n\nWith a valid Bearer token, GET /api/feedback/1 returns HTTP 500 with a Tomcat error page. Extracted content: exception type java.lang.IndexOutOfBoundsException wrapped in javax.servlet.ServletException, Jersey internals (org.glassfish.jersey.servlet.WebComponent/ ServletContainer), and application class/method names with line numbers (com.ibm.security.appscan.altoromutual.util.ServletUtil.getFeedback(ServletUtil.java:234), ...api.FeedbackAPI.getFeedback(FeedbackAPI.java:81)), plus the banner Apache Tomcat/7.0.92. No credentials, secrets, filesystem paths, SQL fragments, or configuration values are disclosed. This is a framework/version banner plus internal class identifiers only, with no reachable exploit or restricted data shown, so it falls below the reporting threshold as a standalone finding (recorded as an observation)."
