          "message": {
            "text": "CSRF / CORS misconfiguration — Not applicable: REST API /api/* authentication and CORS\n\n/api/* authenticates solely via the Authorization: Bearer header (GET /api/account with cookies but no token -> 401), so cookie-based CSRF does not apply. No Access-Control-Allow-Origin is returned for Origin: http://evil.example / null / https://attacker.com and preflight has none, so there is no cross-origin read/write via CORS."
          },
