          "message": {
            "text": "SQL injection — Ruled out: /api/account/{accountNo} accountNo parameter\n\nControl = numeric parsing before use. Authenticated requests with `800002'`, `800002' -- `, `800002 OR 1=1`, `800002' OR '1'='1` and `800002' AND '1'='2` all return HTTP 500 `{Error : For input string: \"800002'...\"}` (java NumberFormatException) with no SQL error and no boolean differential — the value is parsed as a number before any query is built."
